== PART LF: label-flow (RULED): a composed pattern surfaces labels as a literal does; across SEQ one label, the LAST
   MENTION; across `&` a name both sides surface is an ambiguous reference (an error where referenced); a part's
   own label through a label on the part (`[aa = A]`, `aa.h`). Control: the STATIC-ORDER model on libpcre2.
LF A := `/(?<h>\d)/`, B := `/(?:,(?<h>\d))?/`; `A SEQ B` expands to `/(?:(?:(?<h>\d)))(?:(?:(?:,(?<h>\d))?))/`
